{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a09a08322a1a6ed7ea51c05bf63ef26ebb3edd2a347b30f97480d86bf0032e14", "ja": "お疲れさま、奈緒。新しい衣装はどうだ？\nなにか気になることがあれば言ってくれ。", "zh": "辛苦了，奈绪。新衣服怎么样？\n如果有什么在意的地方，就告诉我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "51a49fa456394a00fee17cf6b20049693a42ed866b7a10edd7785abddc424fc4", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}さん！　……ゴホン。\nえっと……何も問題はありませんわ。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}先生！……咳咳。\n那个……没有任何问题呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "73eae3582ae2db4295f6bbd2aea7f0fd40d5a8d7554c21738bb4bfc868ebf830", "ja": "めっちゃ素敵……じゃなくて、とても素敵なお衣装で、\n身も心も引き締まりますわね、おほほほっ！", "zh": "非常棒……不对，是非常华丽的服装，让身心都为之一振呢，哦呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d00ed78c3f793120ec865f47a8543f18939dc6f42dcb43bff11d6c00834fc7f2", "ja": "……。\nどうしたんだ？　悪いものでも食べたのか？", "zh": "……。\n怎么了？吃了什么不该吃的东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "3b98fff9735ec94836508f7a2bdaf493bee8c6b418d77a16b5d6859be73b34f0", "ja": "そうそう！　実は昨日、落ちてたたこ焼きを……って、\nなんでやねーんっ！　私、そこまで腹ペコやないです！", "zh": "对对！其实我昨天吃了掉在地上的章鱼烧……才怪！哪有这种事啊——！我还没饿到那种地步呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "243b18262a22981d4c66286a012f7c54d783db9e207054575fe75e870d9428e8", "ja": "あ、アカン！？　ついノリツッコミしてもうた……。\nせっかくのお淑やかさが台無しや。", "zh": "啊，不行！？一不小心就吐槽得太投入了……。\n好不容易营造出的淑女形象全毁了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1006_p", "source_sha256": "a7e385bf8581729d5a4d62bce4ec5fdb2b261994271b026929debbf3c348fef8", "ja": "え、ゴメン、なにかのボケかと思ったんだけど……。\nお淑やかな感じが出したかったのか？", "zh": "诶，抱歉，我还以为你是在吐槽什么……  \n你是想表现出淑女的感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "1069b886e59479f6b216300cb82d693d8f722e4bbb413114c8a37dbf4b6d4a22", "ja": "そうですよ！　衣装に合わせよう思ったんです。\nまあ、私のガラじゃないのはわかってますけど。", "zh": "是啊！我是想配合一下这身服装嘛。\n不过我也知道，这种风格不适合我就是了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1008_037nao", "source_sha256": "9b5546301c50fce9a93d0daf91cbee1e04fbd5d03754c2c87eb4a5ec6099bc88", "ja": "こういう気品みたいなのって、その人の\n持ってるもんが、自然と出てくるやないですか。", "zh": "像这种气质之类的，不就是一个人自身拥有的东西，自然而然流露出来的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1009_037nao", "source_sha256": "ba87d5e86b79e6ce13e5ef1c247917dfe311a2854c7a888d5411186ea339d677", "ja": "私なんて、ノリと勢いの関西人ですからね。\nお淑やかは程遠いというか、やっぱり難しいわ……。", "zh": "我这种靠气氛和冲劲行事的关西人，离淑女可是差得远了，或者说，果然还是很难啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1010_p", "source_sha256": "146e4cafdf6fc043a5350715e3b8409bd36f7da8b793671f997afcf8c19de882", "ja": "うーん……それはどうだろう？\n奈緒は、じゅうぶんお淑やかだと思うよ。", "zh": "嗯……我觉得不一定吧？\n我认为奈绪已经足够淑女了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1011_037nao", "source_sha256": "6f4bec27424b593645f7184b649860c37669d6d9d047f0164ac7b9355c5a3643", "ja": "えっ？　またまたそんな！　いくら\n{$P$}さんでも、言い過ぎですよ。", "zh": "诶？又来了！就算是{$P$}先生，也说得太过分了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "515f164bd9c2f50ac584eee0e414f19784599e75fc99b9208dafb8188caf4946", "ja": "なんや、私が言わせてしまったみたいやな～。\nごめんなさい！　心にもないこと言わせてもうて。", "zh": "怎么感觉像是我害你说出这种话了～  \n对不起！居然让你说了些言不由衷的话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1013_p", "source_sha256": "343cddb632a7353dc14a4ec3ffa81bbc0dca2303cc99b8dc39dd4c2e4fbad5ab", "ja": "いや、本気だって。髪型の印象が強いのかも\nしれないけど、今日は余計にそう見えるよ。", "zh": "不是，我是认真的。可能是发型给人的印象太强了吧，不过今天看起来尤其如此。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "ae723c45f639e3f201d592915c711bf1cbdb87c8ef1abf08f69e95d4a5dfc761", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　……なんていうか、やっぱこういう\n衣装には、おろした方が似合うかなって思っただけで。", "zh": "是、是吗？……怎么说呢，我只是觉得这种服装还是披着头发更合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1015_037nao", "source_sha256": "5b3738aeae6bcb03d4e327554e16e5e4b26a752826fe061ae9c111851acb0e4c", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……ええと。\nお淑やかな私、変じゃなかったですか？　ホンマに？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……呃。\n温婉文静的我，看起来不奇怪吗？真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1016_p", "source_sha256": "376d3e4d2ba38238a61b90070fd4ae5dbd05d11538620a38a40ac848e4a069eb", "ja": "ああ、言葉遣いは、要練習って感じだけど。\nお淑やかな雰囲気は、すごくあると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯，用词方面感觉还需要多加练习。\n不过，文雅的氛围我觉得还是很浓的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1017_p", "source_sha256": "5792195049cc84f5bd17646d8397223c5687e528379b0a647af29e4e8be4f023", "ja": "明るくて元気なところだけじゃなくて、\n今後は、こういう方向性もいけるかもな！", "zh": "不仅是开朗有活力的一面，今后或许也可以尝试这种风格！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "f6b7d684e07969f8b94ecc377e8dc193b79318f50818a63d7c075213baedf9e7", "ja": "ちょ、ストップストップ！\nアカン、そこまで褒めんといて！　照れる！", "zh": "等、等一下！先停停！\n不行啦，别夸到这种程度！会害羞的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1019_037nao", "source_sha256": "d1d3787c2b6ed8e96dda50d611f50aceecb8bf6b4da4c08e1d8bacf08142ff0b", "ja": "でも、ありがとうございます！　えへへ……♪\nいろいろ意見もらえたおかげで、自信がつきました！", "zh": "不过，还是谢谢你！嘿嘿……♪\n多亏听到了各种意见，我也更有自信了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_037nao0254_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_037nao0254_1020_037nao", "source_sha256": "2b09ec81bafa4e838bc2ad07eafbec0b10d91d8fa97a350e7bf47f9281139fa5", "ja": "よっしゃ！　私なりのお淑やかさでいっくで～！\n……じゃなくて。い、いきますわよ♪　おーほほほっ！", "zh": "好嘞！我就按自己的淑女风格来上咯～！\n……不对。我、这就出发了哦♪　哦～呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
